stages.lessonContentMd:
## Template Literals

Template literals use backticks (`` ` ``) instead of quotes and allow embedding expressions inside `${}`:

```javascript
const hero = "Neo";
const level = 42;
console.log(`Agent ${hero} reached level ${level}.`);
```

stages.starterCode:
const fs = require('fs');
const name = fs.readFileSync(0, 'utf-8').trim();
// Format and print greeting

stages.solutionCode:
